                              Juergen Buchmueller, Andrei I. Holub
  z80_ops.h                   generated from z80.lst by tools/z80gen.py,
                              which is derived from src/devices/cpu/z80/
                              z80make.py: Andre I. Holub
  mooncresta.c, mooncresta.h  src/mame/galaxian/galaxian.cpp, galaxian_v.cpp
                              Aaron Giles, Couriersud, Stephane Humbert,
                              Robbbert
  mooncresta_sound.c, .h      src/mame/galaxian/galaxian_a.cpp
                              Couriersud
                              with the discrete modules of src/devices/sound/
                              disc_dev.hxx, disc_wav.hxx, disc_flt.hxx,
                              disc_mth.hxx: K. Wilkins, Derrick Renaud

romload.c/.h, mcr_port.h and mcr_math.h are original to pico-mooncresta (taken
over from pico-phoenix) and are distributed with the rest of the project under
